// Rests show on a TAB staff (LilyPond \tabFullNotation), drawn with the same
// glyphs as the notation and centred on the tab staff's own vertical middle —
// not the notation "middle line" height. Eighth, quarter and half rests here
// each land between the strings, clear of the fret digits.
part m { instrument bass section A { c4 r8 e8 g4 r4 | c8 r8 r4 r2 | } }
form main { A }
score main { tab m }
